<p>Thanks for the insightful feedback and indeed the praise. I can assure you I did not go out of my way to conform to the rules of Cavalcade (other than to introduce 2 new characters for others to use, and reuse previously introduced ones). As for your last issue, I specifically wanted to avoid what you see as a flaw in Cavalcade's format and conferred with Randomini on where he wanted to take the story. I encourage other authors wanting to develop this plot line to do the same. There's no rule that says you can't.</p>

