			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2037782">
									

<p>If I'm not mistaken, we're now getting into the &quot;main&quot; portion of Cavalcade, yes? Where we're beginning to see characters reused and scenarios revisited instead of continually introducing new ones.</p>
<p>At any rate, I remember this setup (somehow), and I'm now very excited to see where it goes, even though, as Kalinin said, I know pretty darn well that there's no guarantee of any such thing happening. Still, I don't think I've enjoyed an entry to the Cavalcade this much since the first, so that's definitely something.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>selling swimsuits for cats</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Plus, how could I not upvote for this?</p>

